And case 15, genetic diseases.

24
00:01:05.083 --> 00:01:06.814
Where the answers come from.

25
00:01:06.814 --> 00:01:11.017
Almost every answer here is hers: her case study model answer decks,

26
00:01:11.017 --> 00:01:16.394
her recorded case sessions, her fertility quiz, her formative case test, and her posts.

27
00:01:16.394 --> 00:01:20.164
